    "chunk_text": "Abraham exemplum fideliter credentium fuit Her Abraham bysene onstealde geleaffullum, \u00fea he wolde Ubi quinque reges predati sunt Loth Her \u00fea fif cyningas mit hu\u00f0e l\u00e6ddan Loth gebundenne. Abram post praedones currit Her Abram \u00e6fter \u00fe\u00e6re. Abram devictis hostibus recepto Loth cum victoria revertitur Her Abram oferwunnenum feondum Ubi Abram decimas offert et Melchisedech Habrahae panem et vinum, Melchisedech rex et sacerdos dei Ubi tres angeli apparent Abrahe in convalle Mambre. Prudentius orat Her seo gleawnes heo gebit. Fides secura adhuc belli ignara idolatriam repugnat prima Her se goda geleafa \u00e6rest ongean \u00fe\u00e6t Fides conculcat idolatriam Her se geleafa ofertret \u00fe\u00e6t deofolgyld. Fides post victoriam virtutes coronat Her se geleafa \u00e6fter \u00feam sige cynehelmode \u00fea m\u00e6gnu. Pudicitia contra libidinem armis pugnat Her seo cl\u00e6nnes mid w\u00e6pnum win\u00f0 ongean \u00fea fulnesse. Pudicitia libidinem cum saxo percutit Her seo cl\u00e6nnes \u00fea fulnesse mid flinte torfa\u00f0. Pudicitia libidinem transfigit gladio Her nes. Pudicitia libidinem extinctam increpat Her seo cl\u00e6nnes \u00fea fulnesse ofercumene \u00ferea\u00f0. Sancta pudicitia gladium purificat Seo halige cl\u00e6nnes \u00fe\u00e6t sweord feorma\u00f0. Pudicitia gladium suum sub altare in templo recondit Seo cl\u00e6nnes hyre sweord under \u00feam weofode on Ubi patientia inter acies vitiorum intrepida stat Her werode. Ira patientiam conto percutit Her \u00fe\u00e6t yrre \u00fe\u00e6t ge\u00feyld mid \u00feam sceafte slih\u00f0. Ira patientiam incre",
